From 53d823eaac4074ab426182d69318f24732341951 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@local>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 21:10:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] M-6: close mediated delegation per ADR-0090

- fold ChildSpawned/ChildReturned into LedgerState.children (was UNFOLDED_ALLOWLIST)
- add ChildRecord; open until ChildReturned, cold path reconciles
- register spawn_adapter as sole writer of both kinds
- lazy model adapter imports (140.8ms -> 12.9ms cold start)

Kernel untouched. Suite unchanged at 1294 passed / 8 failed.
---
 test/contracts/test_event_coverage.py         |  2 -
 vanguard/packages/adapters/models/__init__.py | 52 +++++++++++++------
 vanguard/packages/domain/ledger/reducer.py    | 38 ++++++++++++++
 vanguard/packages/domain/ledger/state.py      | 24 +++++++++
 vanguard/packages/runtime/ledger_emitter.py   |  4 ++
 5 files changed, 101 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

diff --git a/test/contracts/test_event_coverage.py b/test/contracts/test_event_coverage.py
index 9d68b26..38ed7a0 100644
--- a/test/contracts/test_event_coverage.py
